	year = {1973},
	keywords = {Fermion systems; Many-body problems; Fermion n-representability; Mutual relations; Eigenvalue},
	language = {English},
	abstract = {Two necessary conditions for N-representability of fermion 2-matrices are studied. Each determines a convex set which contains the set of N-representable 2-matrices. The mutual relations of these three sets are discussed. When the rank of the fermion system is less than or equal to N+2 these conditions are necessary and sufficient. A variation procedure, involving only D/sup 2/, is given for obtaining upper and lower bounds on the lowest eigenvalue of any two-particle observable.}
